            {
              "text": "In Adelaide’s tightly held prestige market ($3M to $10M+), a substantial proportion of trophy sales never reach public portals like Realestate.com.au or Domain. Vendors typically prefer discretion, non-disclosure agreements (NDAs), and tailored access to verified high-net-worth (HNW) and ultra-high-net-worth (UHNW) buyer networks.\n\nLeading boutique agencies and high-profile luxury agents in Adelaide specialize in confidential, off-market sales:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Premier Luxury Boutiques & Market Leaders\n\n#### **WILLIAMS Luxury Real Estate**\n* **Key Agents:** Stephanie Williams & John Williams\n* **Profile:** Stephanie Williams is widely regarded as the benchmark for luxury real estate sales in South Australia. The agency routinely handles multi-million-dollar transactions across Adelaide’s top pockets (often setting suburb and state price records).\n* **Network & Strategy:** They operate a comprehensive private client register of local business leaders, medical professionals, and interstate/ex-pat buyers. A substantial portion of their transaction volume is transacted discreetly off-market before any public advertising is considered.\n* **Core Suburbs:** Unley Park, Medindie, Malvern, Hyde Park, Walkerville, North Adelaide, and prestige Adelaide Hills retreats.\n\n#### **Giordano & Partners Luxury Real Estate**\n* **Key Agents:** Grant Giordano, Anthony Hurl\n* **Profile:** Modeled after high-end international brokerage houses, Giordano & Partners focuses on low-volume, high-touch sales of irreplaceable architectural, coastal, and heritage estates.\n* **Network & Strategy:** Grant Giordano has deep connections into Asian, European, and US-based HNW wealth networks and expatriates. The firm is celebrated for its discretion, bespoke concierge approach, and ability to coordinate private inspections exclusively for pre-vetted buyers without a digital footprint.\n* **Core Suburbs:** Medindie, Gilberton, Walkerville, Beaumont, coastal strip (Tennyson, Grange, Glenelg South), and Adelaide Hills.\n\n#### **Booth & Booth Real Estate**\n* **Key Agents:** Jamie Brown, Patrick Booth\n* **Profile:** A quiet, ultra-established prestige brand steeped in Adelaide's generational wealth networks. Jamie Brown is consistently involved in some of the most expensive and private residential sales in South Australia.\n* **Network & Strategy:** They work via long-standing relationships with old-money families, private banking contacts, and institutional partners. Many of their top-tier sales are conducted entirely via private treaty or direct expression-of-interest without ever going public.\n* **Core Suburbs:** Unley Park, Medindie, Fitzroy, North Adelaide, and eastern city-fringe grand estates.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Large Independents with Dedicated Off-Market Ecosystems\n\n#### **Harris Real Estate (Harris Off-Market / Prestige)**\n* **Key Agents:** Phil Harris, Kris Bartley, Arabella Hooper (Prestige / Adelaide Hills)\n* **Profile:** Adelaide’s largest independent agency has institutionalized the off-market process through a dedicated digital ecosystem, **Harris Off-Market**.\n* **Network & Strategy:** Harris maintains a database of tens of thousands of active and registered buyers. For off-market prestige property, they filter down to qualified tier-one buyers, sharing listings silently via closed syndicates, curated SMS/EDM dispatches, and private viewing appointments.\n* **Core Suburbs:** Adelaide Hills (Stirling, Aldgate), Toorak Gardens, Rose Park, Tennyson, Leabrook.\n\n#### **Ouwens Casserly (OC) Real Estate**\n* **Key Agents:** Cynthia Sajkunovic, Michael Stentiford, Nathan Casserly\n* **Profile:** A major market player with strong reach across both heritage Eastern suburbs and prime coastal belts.\n* **Network & Strategy:** Cynthia Sajkunovic is known for brokering top-dollar beachside and inner-south transactions. Michael and Angela Stentiford have built a targeted niche around off-market matchmaking, often working closely with only 40–50 qualified UHNW buyers at any given time to protect vendor privacy.\n* **Core Suburbs:** Henley Beach, Tennyson, Grange, Millswood, Unley Park, Kensington Gardens.\n\n#### **Klemich Real Estate**\n* **Key Agents:** Matt Smith, Penny Riggs\n* **Profile:** Deeply rooted in Adelaide’s eastern and inner-northern character homes and grand heritage villas.\n* **Network & Strategy:** Excellent organic network among Adelaide’s medical, legal, and academic elite. They frequently orchestrate \"silent sales\" through direct introductions without signboards or web listings.\n* **Core Suburbs:** Medindie, North Adelaide, Rose Park, Toorak Gardens, Norwood.\n\n---\n\n### Summary Comparison for HNW Vendors & Buyers\n\n| Agency / Agent | Primary Prestige Strength | Best For |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **WILLIAMS** (Stephanie Williams) | Historic records, inner-east villas, top market turnover | Highest-profile trophy estates wanting swift, premium results |\n| **Giordano & Partners** (Grant Giordano) | International & interstate buyer outreach, architectural/unique builds | Global HNW exposure with total local discretion |\n| **Booth & Booth** (Jamie Brown) | Generational wealth, quiet unlisted sales, inner-east/north | Vendors seeking absolute privacy and no public footprint |\n| **Harris Real Estate** (Phil Harris) | Scaled VIP buyer database, Adelaide Hills estates | Pre-market testing through verified buyer matching |\n| **OC Real Estate** (Cynthia Sajkunovic) | Coastal luxury, seafront mansions, and inner south | Esplanade holdings and bespoke private viewings |\n\n### Practical Tip for Engaging in this Market\nWhen engaging these agencies as a **buyer**, agents will generally require an initial briefing interview and proof of capacity or pre-qualification before sharing silent inventory. As a **vendor**, specify upfront whether you require a **\"Blind/Silent\" strategy** (direct one-on-one introductions under NDA) or an **\"Off-Market Database\" strategy** (discreetly circulated exclusively within the agency's private VIP list without external media).",
